<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Velora X1 — Discord, under control</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"></head><body><nav class="nav"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="mark">V</span> VELORA <b>X1</b></a><div><a href="#features">Features</a><a href="#commands">Commands</a><a class="nav-cta" href="/auth/login">Dashboard Login</a></div></nav><main><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY MANAGEMENT, REIMAGINED</p><h1>One command center.<br><span>Every community.</span></h1><p class="lead">Velora X1 brings moderation, server safety, logging, community tools and role building into one clean Discord experience.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/auth/login">Open dashboard ↗</a><a class="btn secondary" href="/invite">Add to Discord</a></div><div class="stats"><div><strong>100</strong><small>Slash commands</small></div><div><strong>150</strong><small>Prefix commands</small></div><div><strong>Railway</strong><small>Ready to deploy</small></div></div></div><div class="hero-art"><img src="/images/hero.svg" alt="Velora X1 command center artwork"></div></section><section id="features" class="section"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">BUILT FOR REAL COMMUNITIES</p><h2>Tools that work together.</h2><p>Configure the features you need and keep your team informed.</p></div><div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature"><img src="/images/moderation.svg" alt="Moderation artwork"><h3>Moderation</h3><p>Warnings, timeouts, kicks, bans, message cleanup and confirmation prompts.</p></article><article class="feature"><img src="/images/security.svg" alt="Security artwork"><h3>Security</h3><p>Join-spike alerts, security diagnostics and anti-nuke monitoring foundations.</p></article><article class="feature"><img src="/images/logging.svg" alt="Logging artwork"><h3>Logging</h3><p>Choose destinations for messages, images, moderation and member activity.</p></article><article class="feature"><img src="/images/community.svg" alt="Role builder artwork"><h3>Role builder</h3><p>Create visually grouped region, age, gender, color and community roles.</p></article></div></section><section id="commands" class="command-band"><div><p class="eyebrow">A COMMAND FOR THE MOMENT</p><h2>Fast in chat.<br>Clear on the dashboard.</h2><p>Use slash commands for discoverability and prefix commands for familiar workflows. Every catalog entry includes a description.</p><a class="btn" href="/auth/login">Configure your server</a></div><div class="command-card"><div class="cmd-line"><span>/</span><b>timeout</b><small>Timeout a member</small></div><div class="cmd-line"><span>!</span><b>warn</b><small>Warn and DM a member</small></div><div class="cmd-line"><span>/</span><b>securitycheck</b><small>Check bot permissions</small></div><div class="cmd-line"><span>/</span><b>poll</b><small>Create a reaction poll</small></div><div class="cmd-note">Designed to grow with your community.</div></div></section><footer><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="mark">V</span> VELORA <b>X1</b></a><span>Community-first tools. Thoughtful controls.</span><a href="/health">System status</a></footer></main></body></html>
